olden-frozen: FAILED (1 errors)')) { throw ('missing FAILED line: ' + $o) }; Write-Output 'AC-073 OK'`\n162\t- 期望: 输出含 FAIL golden.changed contracts/golden/b44.json 与 check-golden-frozen: FAILED (1 errors)，退出码 1。\n163\t\n164\t## AC-073 F-4 新增金标后冻结检查失败\n165\t\n166\t- 命令: `$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) 'ac073-add'; Remove-Item $t -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; New-Item -ItemType Directory $t | Out-Null; Copy-Item contracts -Destination $t -Recurse; Set-Content -Encoding utf8NoBOM \"$t/contracts/golden/extra.json\" '{}'; $o = (node scripts/check-golden-frozen.mjs --root $t 2>&1 | Out-String); $e = $LASTEXITCODE; Remove-Item $t -Recurse -Force; if ($e -ne 1) { throw \"exit $e\" }; if (-not $o.Contains('FAIL golden.unregistered contracts/golden/extra.json')) { throw ('missing unregistered line: ' + $o) }; if (-not $o.Contains('check-golden-frozen: FAILED (1 errors)')) { throw ('missing FAILED line: ' + $o) }; Write-Output 'AC-073 OK'`\n167\t- 期望: 输出含 FAIL golden.unregistered contracts/golden/extra.json 与 check-golden-frozen: FAILED (1 errors)，退出码 1。\n168\t\n169\t## AC-073 F-5 删除金标后冻结检查失败\n170\t\n171\t- 命令: `$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) 'ac073-del'; Remove-Item $t -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; New-Item -ItemType Directory $t | Out-Null; Copy-Item contracts -Destination $t -Recurse; Remove-Item \"$t/contracts/golden/capacity.json\"; $o = (node scripts/check-golden-frozen.mjs --root $t 2>&1 | Out-String); $e = $LASTEXITCODE; Remove-Item $t -Recurse -Force; if ($e -ne 1) { throw \"exit $e\" }; if (-not $o.Contains('FAIL golden.missing contracts/golden/capacity.json')) { throw ('missing missing-line: ' + $o) }; if (-not $o.Contains('check-golden-frozen: FAILED (1 errors)')) { throw ('missing FAILED line: ' + $o) }; Write-Output 'AC-073 OK'`\n172\t- 期望: 输出含 FAIL golden.missing contracts/golden/capacity.json 与 check-golden-frozen: FAILED (1 errors)，退出码 1。\n173\t\n174\t## AC-073 F-6 登记清单之外的规格文件\n175\t\n176\t- 命令: `$t = Join-Path ([IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) 'ac073-ws'; Remove-Item $t -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; New-Item -ItemType Directory $t | Out-Null; Copy-Item contracts -Destination $t -Recurse; Set-Content -Encoding utf8NoBOM \"$t/contracts/spec/x.json\" '{}'; $o = (node scripts/check-write-scope.mjs --root $t 2>&1 | Out-String); $e = $LASTEXITCODE; Remove-Item $t -Recurse -Force; if ($e -ne 1) { throw \"exit $e\" }; if (-not $o.Contains('FAIL write_scope.unregistered contracts/spec/x.json')) { throw ('missing unregistered line: ' + $o) }; if (-not $o.Contains('check-write-scope: FAILED (1 errors)')) { throw ('missing FAILED line: ' + $o) }; Write-Output 'AC-073 OK'`\n177\t- 期望: 输出含 FAIL write_scope.unregistered contracts/spec/x.json 与 check-write-scope: FAILED (1 errors)，退出码 1。\n178\t\n179\t## AC-073 F-7 写域检查（登记模式）通过\n180\t\n181\t- 命令: `$o = (node scripts/check-write-scope.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String); $e = $LASTEXITCODE; if ($e -ne 0) { throw \"exit $e\" }; if (-not $o.Contains('check-write-scope: ok')) { throw ('unexpected output: ' + $o) }; Write-Output 'AC-073 OK'`\n182\t- 期望: 输出 check-write-scope: ok，退出码 0。\n183\t\n184\t## AC-073 F-8 本任务全部变更落在 design.md 的 write_scope 内\n185\t\n186\t- 命令: `$o = (node scripts/check-write-scope.mjs --base 93ebbb3 --scope-from .collab/tasks/004/design.md --scope '.collab/tasks/004/**' 2>&1 | Out-String); $e = $LASTEXITCODE; if ($e -ne 0) { throw ('exit ' + $e + ': ' + $o) }; if (-not $o.Contains('check-write-scope: ok')) { throw ('unexpected output: ' + $o) }; Write-Output 'AC-073 OK'`\n187\t- 期望: 输出 check-write-scope: ok，退出码 0。\n188\t- 期望: 变更集不越出 design.md 的 write_scope（.collab/tasks/004/** 只用于放行调度器自己的运行产物）。\n189\t\n190\t## AC-073 F-9 范围检查能报出越界变更\n191\t\n192\t- 命令: `$o = (node scripts/check-write-scope.mjs --base 93ebbb3 --scope 'lib/contract/**' 2>&1 | Out-String); $e = $LASTEXITCODE; if ($e -ne 1) { throw \"exit $e\" }; if (-not $o.Contains('FAIL write_scope.outside')) { throw ('missing outside line: ' + $o) }; if (-not $o.Conta