213\t\n214\t- 命令: `$o = (node scripts/check-contract-doc.mjs 2>&1 | Out-String); $e = $LASTEXITCODE; if ($e -ne 0) { throw ('exit ' + $e + ': ' + $o) }; if (-not $o.Contains('check-contract-doc: ok')) { throw ('unexpected output: ' + $o) }; Write-Output 'AC-073 OK'`\n215\t- 期望: 输出 check-contract-doc: ok，退出码 0。\n216\t\n217\t## AC-073 F-14 渲染结果与已提交文档逐字节一致\n218\t\n219\t- 命令: `node --input-type=module -e \"import {renderContractDoc} from './scripts/gen-contract-doc.mjs'; import fs from 'node:fs'; const a=renderContractDoc('.'); const b=fs.readFileSync('docs/contract.md','utf8'); if(a!==b.replace(/\\r\\n/g,'\\n')){throw new Error('render mismatch')}; if(a.includes('\\r')){throw new Error('CR found')}; if(a.charCodeAt(0)===0xFEFF){throw new Error('BOM found')}; if(!a.endsWith('\\n')||a.endsWith('\\n\\n')){throw new Error('trailing newline mismatch')}; console.log('AC-073 OK')\"`\n220\t- 期望: 渲染结果归一化后与 docs/contract.md 全等，且无 CR、无 BOM、末尾恰一个换行。\n221\t\n222\t## AC-073 F-15 文档的固定章节标题\n223\t\n224\t- 命令: `node -e \"const t=require('fs').readFileSync('docs/contract.md','utf8');const h=t.split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(l=>/^#{1,2} /.test(l));const want=['# CLIWorker 契约（自动生成）','## 1. 错误码','## 2. 403 触发与判定顺序','## 3. 警告码','## 4. 拒选原因','## 5. draft 到 v1 的原因映射','## 6. forecast 枚举与阈值','## 7. 可用性与 identity','## 8. semantic_change','## 9. 规格与金标登记清单','## 10. 契约 schema 清单'];if(h.length!==want.length){throw new Error('heading count '+h.length)};for(let i=0;i<want.length;i+=1){if(h[i]!==want[i]){throw new Error('line '+i+' is '+h[i])}};console.log('AC-073 OK')\"`\n225\t- 期望: 11 个标题逐行与 design 第 10.1 节的字面值一致。\n226\t\n227\t## AC-073 F-16 本任务产物已被 git 跟踪\n228\t\n229\t- 命令: `node -e \"const {execFileSync}=require('child_process');const out=execFileSync('git',['ls-files','--','contracts','lib/contract','scripts','docs/contract.md','test/contract','test/fixtures/no-collab','test/traceability/T-004.json'],{encoding:'utf8'}).split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(Boolean);const want=['contracts/registry.snapshot.json','contra