{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C7rir2cuxX4BjD8m5K62BF","type":"tool_result","content":"498\t| frac-1 | null | none | 1 | ok | fraction |\n499\t| priority-tasks-over-fraction | 10 | tasks | 0.01 | ok | tasks |\n500\t| priority-usd-over-fraction | 1 | usd | 0.9 | critical | usd |\n501\t| unknown-none | null | none | null | unknown | none |\n502\t\n503\t**`quantiles.json`**（kind `forecast-quantiles`，`fn:\"quantile_for_usage\"`，`input={samples, usage}`，`expected={value}`；Heavy/Normal/Light 分别取 p90/p50/p25，nearest-rank `sorted[ceil(p*n)-1]`，n<3 时 value 为 null）：\n504\t\n505\t| id | samples | usage | value |\n506\t|---|---|---|---|\n507\t| n3-heavy / n3-normal / n3-light | [0.1,0.2,0.3] | Heavy / Normal / Light | 0.3 / 0.2 / 0.1 |\n508\t| n4-unsorted-heavy / -normal / -light | [0.4,0.1,0.3,0.2] | Heavy / Normal / Light | 0.4 / 0.2 / 0.1 |\n509\t| n12-heavy / -normal / -light | [1,2,…,12] | Heavy / Normal / Light | 11 / 6 / 3 |\n510\t| n20-heavy / -normal / -light | [1,2,…,20] | Heavy / Normal / Light | 18 / 10 / 5 |\n511\t| n2-invalid | [0.1,0.2] | Normal | null |\n512\t| n1-invalid | [0.5] | Normal | null |\n513\t| n0-invalid | [] | Normal | null |\n514\t\n515\t（表中一行代表三个 case，case id 为「前缀 + 用量」，如 `n3-heavy`。）\n516\t\n517\t**`confidence.json`**（kind `forecast-confidence`，`fn:\"confidence\"`，`input={n, cv}`，`expected={confidence}`）：n0→none；n1→low；n4→low；n5→medium；n19→medium；n20+cv0.5→high；n20+cv1→high；n20+cv1.01→medium；n50+cv2→medium；n10+cv3→medium；n3+cv5→low。case id：`n0`、`n1`、`n4`、`n5`、`n19`、`n20-cv0.5`、`n20-cv1`、`n20-cv1.01`、`n50-cv2`、`n10-cv3`、`n3-cv5`；`cv` 不适用时为 null。\n518\t\n519\t**`burn-eta.json`**（kind `forecast-burn-eta`）：\n520\t\n521\t| id | fn | input | expected |\n522\t|---|---|---|---|\n523\t| burn-5.5-over-5h | burn_mtok_per_hour | {used_mtok:5.5, hours_since_window_start:5} | {value:1.1} |\n524\t| burn-clamp-zero-hours | burn_mtok_per_hour | {used_mtok:0.3, hours_since_window_start:0} | {value:18} |\n525\t| burn-clamp-tiny-hours | burn_mtok_per_hour | {used_mtok:1, hours_since_window_start:0.001} | {value:60} |\n526\t| burn-rounding | burn_mtok_per_hour | {used_mtok:2, hours_since_window_start:3} | {value:0.667} |\n527\t| burn-zero-used | burn_mtok_per_hour | {used_mtok:0, hours_since_window_start:4} | {value:0} |\n528\t| eta-after-reset | eta_exhaust | {now:\"2026-11-07T10:00:00.000Z\", remaining_mtok:5, burn_mtok_per_hour:2, reset_at:\"2026-11-07T12:00:00.000Z\"} | {eta_exhaust_at:\"2026-11-07T12:30:00.000Z\", exhausts_before_reset:false} |\n529\t| eta-before-reset | eta_exhaust | {now 同上, remaining_mtok:1, burn_mtok_per_hour:2, reset_at 同上} | {eta_exhaust_at:\"2026-11-07T10:30:00.000Z\", exhausts_before_reset:true} |\n530\t| eta-equal-reset | eta_exhaust | {now 同上, remaining_mtok:1, burn_mtok_per_hour:0.5, reset_at 同上} | {eta_exhaust_at:\"2026-11-07T12:00:00.000Z\", exhausts_before_reset:false} |\n531\t| eta-empty | eta_exhaust | {now 同上, remaining_mtok:0, burn_mtok_per_hour:2, reset_at 同上} | {eta_exhaust_at:\"2026-11-07T10:00:00.000Z\", exhausts_before_reset:true} |\n532\t| round3-0.0625 | round3 | {value:0.0625} | {value:0.063} |\n533\t| round3-0.1875 | round3 | {value:0.1875} | {value:0.188} |\n534\t| round3-negative | round3 | {value:-0.0625} | {value:-0.063} |\n535\t| round3-down | round3 | {value:1.2344} | {value:1.234} |\n536\t| round3-zero | round3 | {value:0} | {value:0} |\n537\t\n538\t公式出处：burn = 窗口内已用 Mtok / max(距窗口起点小时数, 1/60)；eta = now + remaining/burn；`exhausts_before_reset` 为 `eta < reset_at`（严格小于）；三位小数四舍五入远离零。\n539\t\n540\t### 9.5 `contracts/golden/capacity.json`（kind `capacity`，`fn:\"learn_capacity\"`，AC-050）\n541\t\n542\t`input = {readings:[{at,fraction}], rows:[{at,tokens}]}`。配对：相邻两个读数构成一对；Δ = 后者 fraction − 前者 fraction；一对的 tokens = `at` 落在（前者.at, 后者.at] 内的行的 tokens 之和；只有 Δ ≥ 0.01 的对计入；`capacity_mtok = sum(tokens)/sum(Δ)/1e6`；k 为计入的对数；k<3 low，3..9 medium，≥10 high；`source` 恒为 `measured`。`expected = {capacity_mtok, k, confidence, source}`。所有 fraction 取二进制精确值，避免浮点差。\n543\t\n544\t| id | readings（时间均在 2026-11-07，UTC） | rows | expected |\n545\t|---|---|---|---|\n546\t| cap-k2-low | 08:00 0；09:00 0.25；10:00 0.5 | 08:30 1000000；09:30 1000000 | capacity 4, k 2, low |\n547\t| cap-k3-medium | 07:00 0；08:00 0.125；09:00 0.25；10:00 0.375 | 07:30 1000000；08:30 500000；09:30 1500000 | capacity 8, k 3, medium |\n548\t| cap-k10-high | 11 个读数，整点 00:00…10:00，fraction 依次 i×0.03125（i=0..10） | 10 行，每行 250000，分别在 00:30、01:30…09:30 | capacity 8, k 10, high |\n549\t| cap-discard-small-delta | 08:00 0.5；09:00 0.5078125；10:00 0.7578125 | 08:30 100000；09:30 2000000 | capacity 8, k 1, low（第一对 Δ=0.0078125 被丢弃） |\n550\t| cap-reset-pair-ignored | 08:00 0.5；09:00 0.0625；10:00 0.3125 | 08:30 300000；09:30 2000000 | capacity 8, k 1, low（第一对 Δ 为负，被丢弃） |\n551\t\n552\t每个 expected 都含 `source:\"measured\"`。\n553\t\n554\t### 9.6 `contracts/golden/policy/*.json`（kind `policy`，`fn:\"select_policy\"`，AC-051，四个文件）\n555\t\n556\t`input = {est_mtok, count, importance, policy:{unknown_policy, reserve_fraction_for_high}, reserve_mtok, pools, candidates}`：所有 case 的 `est_mtok` 为 1，`importance` 为 `high`，`reserve_mtok` 为 0，`reserve_fraction_for_high` 为 0.15。`pools` 元素 `{id, funding, remaining_mtok, cap_mtok, reset_in_h}`（`remaining_mtok` 可为 null 表示未知，`reset_in_h` 不适用为 null）；`candidates` 元素 `{key, pool_ids, price, identity_group}`。`expected = {selected:[{key,funding}], rejected:[{key,reason}]}`，`selected` 按输出顺序，`rejected` 只列被过滤拒选的候选（因 count 截断而未入选的不算拒选），按候选在 input 中的顺序。\n557\t\n558\t| 文件 | case id | pools | candidates | count / unknown_policy | expected |\n559\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n560\t| p1-order.json | p1-order | A{plan,3,cap10,reset 1}；B{plan,8,cap10,reset 4}；C{paid,100,cap100,null} | mA{[A],price 2}；mB{[B],price 1}；mC{[C],price 3}，identity_group 均 null | 3 / after_known | selected: mA plan, mB plan, mC paid；rejected: [] |\n561\t| p2-quota-low.json | p2-quota-low | A{plan,0.5,cap10,reset 1}；C{paid,100,cap100,null} | mA{[A],1}；mC{[C],3} | 1 / after_known | selected: mC paid；rejected: mA quota_low |\n562\t| p3-unknown.json | p3-after-known | A{plan,3,cap10,reset 1}；U{plan,null,cap10,null}；C{paid,100,cap100,null} | mA{[A],1}；mU{[U],1}；mC{[C],3} | 3 / after_known | selected: mA plan, mU plan, mC paid；rejected: [] |\n563\t| p3-unknown.json | p3-reject | 同上 | 同上 | 3 / reject | selected: mA plan, mC paid；rejected: mU quota_unknown_policy |\n564\t| p4-identity-group.json | p4-distinct-group | A{plan,10,cap20,reset 2} | m1{[A],1,g1}；m2{[A],2,g1}；m3{[A],3,g2} | 2 / after_known | selected: m1 plan, m3 plan；rejected: [] |\n565\t| p4-identity-group.json | p4-fill-same-group | 同上 | m1{[A],1,g1}；m2{[A],2,g1}；m3{[A],3,g1} | 2 / after_known | selected: m1 plan, m2 plan；rejected: [] |\n566\t\n567\tP1 排序依据：A 类按紧迫度 `remaining/max(reset_in_h,0.25)` 降序，A=3、B=2，所以 A 先于 B（即使 mA 更贵）；之后 B 类（未知）、C 类（付费，funding 标 `paid`）。\n568\t\n569\t### 9.7 必需 case id\n570\t\n571\t测试（`[AC-073] golden files hold the required case ids`）核对每个文件至少包含上面各表的全部 case id，且 `kind` 正确、id 唯一。\n572\t\n573\t## 10. 生成文档与检查脚本\n574\t\n575\t### 10.1 `scripts/gen-contract-doc.mjs`\n576\t\n577\t`node scripts/gen-contract-doc.mjs [--root <dir>]` 写出 `<root>/docs/contract.md`，输出 `gen-contract-doc: wrote docs/contract.md (<N> bytes)`。导出 `renderContractDoc(root)` → 字符串（check 脚本复用；`root` 为相对或绝对目录，相对路径按当前工作目录解析）。脚本只在被直接运行时才写文件，被 import 时不得有副作用（沿用 `scripts/run-tests.mjs` 的 `invokedDirectly` 写法）；`check-*.mjs` 与 `snapshot-update.mjs` 同理。内容只依赖仓库文件（快照、manifest、`contracts/schemas` 目录列表），不含时间戳、绝对路径、环境信息。固定结构（标题字面值）：\n578\t\n579\t```\n580\t# CLIWorker 契约（自动生成）\n581\t> 本文件由 scripts/gen-contract-doc.mjs 生成，请勿手改。snapshot_version: <N>\n582\t## 1. 错误码              // 表：code | exit | http_status | retryable | trigger_id | trigger；退出码 0 的说明另起一行\n583\t## 2. 403 触发与判定顺序   // 五个 403 类码的 trigger_id 与 write_route_order\n584\t## 3. 警告码\n585\t## 4. 拒选原因            // v1、admin_only、draft 三组\n586\t## 5. draft 到 v1 的原因映射\n587\t## 6. forecast 枚举与阈值   // forecast_reasons、risk、risk_basis、tasks_left_basis、两张阈值表、priority\n588\t## 7. 可用性与 identity\n589\t## 8. semantic_change\n590\t## 9. 规格与金标登记清单    // manifest 的 path 与 sha256 表\n591\t## 10. 契约 schema 清单     // contracts/schemas 下的文件名，码点升序\n592\t```\n593\tMarkdown 表格单元里的 `|` 转义为 `\\|`；输出 LF、UTF-8 无 BOM、末尾恰一个换行；顺序都取快照/manifest 的书写顺序（schema 清单按码点升序）。\n594\t\n595\t### 10.2 `scripts/check-contract-doc.mjs`\n596\t\n597\t`node scripts/check-contract-doc.mjs [--root <dir>]`：重新生成并与 `<root>/docs/contract.md` 比较（两侧先把 `\\r\\n` 换成 `\\n`）。一致：`check-contract-doc: ok`，exit 0；文件不存在：`FAIL contract_doc.missing docs/contract.md`；内容不同：`FAIL contract_doc.stale docs/contract.md`；两种失败末行都是 `check-contract-doc: FAILED (1 errors)`，exit 1。\n598\t\n599\t### 10.3 `scripts/check-no-collab.mjs`\n600\t\n601\t`node scripts/check-no-collab.mjs [--root <dir>]`。扫描 `<root>` 下 `lib`、`scripts`、`test`、`contracts`、`docs` 目录的全部文件（跳过 `node_modules`、`.git`；默认模式额外跳过相对路径以 `test/fixtures/no-collab/` 开头的文件）与 `package.json`，逐行做不区分大小写的子串匹配，匹配目标是一个点加 `collab`（蓝图目录名）。**本脚本、测试、夹具生成代码都必须用拼接方式构造该字面量**（例如 `['.', 'coll', 'ab'].join('')`），否则脚本会扫到自己。输出：命中一行 `FAIL no_collab <相对路径>:<行号>`，按路径码点升序、行号升序；末行失败 `check-no-collab: FAILED (<K> violations)` exit 1；成功 `check-no-collab: ok (scanned <N> files)` exit 0。目录不存在则跳过该目录。\n602\t\n603\t夹具（`test/fixtures/no-collab/`，字节内容固定，每个文件只含下表所述的一处命中；文件名都不以 `.test.mjs` 结尾）：\n604\t\n605\t| 路径 | 内容要点 |\n606\t|---|---|\n607\t| `violating/lib/a.mjs` | 第 1 行含一个点加 collab 的相对导入路径 |\n608\t| `violating/scripts/b.mjs` | 第 2 行是注释，含一个点加 collab 的路径 |\n609\t| `violating/test/c.txt` | 第 1 行含该字符串 |\n610\t| `violating/contracts/d.json` | 第 2 行的某个字符串值含该字符串 |\n611\t| `violating/docs/e.md` | 第 3 行含全大写形式（大小写不敏感的样例） |\n612\t| `violating/package.json` | 第 2 行的某个字段值含该字符串 |\n613\t| `clean/lib/a.mjs`、`clean/package.json` | 不含该字符串 |\n614\t\n615\t因此 `--root test/fixtures/no-collab/violating` 恰好输出 6 行 `FAIL`：`contracts/d.json:2`、`docs/e.md:3`、`lib/a.mjs:1`、`package.json:2`、`scripts/b.mjs:2`、`test/c.txt:1`；`--root test/fixtures/no-collab/clean` 输出 `check-no-collab: ok (scanned 2 files)`。夹具文件需要显式 `git add`（若被 `.gitignore` 误伤要在设计外另行处理；当前 `.gitignore` 不会命中它们）。\n616\t\n617\t## 11. 测试（五个文件，标题逐字固定）\n618\t\n619\t- 所有测试用 `node:test` 的平铺 `test()`，不用 `describe`。需要临时文件时一律建在 `os.tmpdir()` 下，用完删除；不得在仓库里生成临时文件。\n620\t- 需要调用脚本时用 `spawnSync(process.execPath, [script, ...args, '--root', tmp])`，不得在测试里再启动 `run-tests`/`check-fast`（会递归）。\n621\t- 需要 git 时在临时目录 `git init`，命令加 `-c user.name=t -c user.email=t@t -c commit.gpgsign=false`。\n622\t\n623\t| 文件 | 标题 |\n624\t|---|---|\n625\t| `registry.test.mjs` | `[AC-009] REGISTRY deep-equals contracts/registry.snapshot.json` |\n626\t| | `[AC-009] every code has exit, http_status, retryable, trigger_id and trigger` |\n627\t| | `[AC-009] trigger_id and trigger text are unique across the table` |\n628\t| | `[AC-009] codes, exits and retryable flags match the frozen exit-code table` |\n629\t| | `[AC-009] the five 403 codes have mutually exclusive triggers` |\n630\t| | `[AC-009] write route order is session, readonly, csrf, body` |\n631\t| | `[AC-009] resolveView applies the select view rules` |\n632\t| | `[AC-009] lib/contract modules are pure and import nothing` |\n633\t| `examples.test.mjs` | `[AC-009] every schema uses only supported keywords` |\n634\t| | `[AC-009] every valid example passes its schema` |\n635\t| | `[AC-009] every invalid example fails with exactly the declared path and keyword` |\n636\t| | `[AC-009] every wire schema has one valid and two invalid examples` |\n637\t| | `[AC-009] schema enums for codes, warnings and reject reasons equal the registry` |\n638\t| | `[AC-009] validator reports the expected path for each supported keyword` |\n639\t| | `[AC-009] examples carry no token-like strings` |\n640\t| `freeze.test.mjs` | `[AC-010] compareRegistry reports removed for a deleted code` |\n641\t| | `[AC-010] compareRegistry reports removed and added for a renamed code` |\n642\t| | `[AC-010] compareRegistry reports changed for a modified field` |\n643\t| | `[AC-010] compareRegistry reports nothing for identical registries` |\n644\t| | `[AC-010] checkFrozen fails for a deleted code, a renamed code and an added code with a stale snapshot` |\n645\t| | `[AC-010] snapshot-update is a no-op on an unchanged registry` |\n646\t| | `[AC-010] snapshot-update writes the snapshot only when snapshot_version is previous plus one` |\n647\t| | `[AC-010] snapshot-update refuses an addition without a version bump` |\n648\t| | `[AC-010] snapshot-update refuses removed, renamed or changed entries` |\n649\t| | `[AC-010] snapshot holds reject reasons, risk thresholds, availability, warning codes, draft mapping and semantic_change` |\n650\t| `scan-canary.test.mjs` | `[AC-011] every forbidden key is detected at depth 1` |\n651\t| | `[AC-011] every forbidden key is detected at depth 3` |\n652\t| | `[AC-011] forbidden keys are detected inside arrays, warnings, error and rejected` |\n653\t| | `[AC-011] forbidden key matching is case-insensitive and exact` |\n654\t| | `[AC-011] every forbidden value is detected at depth 1 and depth 3` |\n655\t| | `[AC-011] forbidden values match whole words after tokenizing` |\n656\t| | `[AC-011] cliworker, config and dsh-CLIWorker are not reported` |\n657\t| | `[AC-011] the call subtree skips value scanning but must equal the wrapper template` |\n658\t| | `[AC-011] clean examples produce zero hits` |\n659\t| | `[AC-011] deeply nested input does not overflow the stack` |\n660\t| `spec-tracked.test.mjs` | `[AC-073] snapshot, spec, golden and forbidden files are tracked by git and not ignored` |\n661\t| | `[AC-073] every spec and golden file validates against its schema` |\n662\t| | `[AC-073] golden files hold the required case ids` |\n663\t| | `[AC-073] manifest registers every spec and golden file with its normalized sha256` |\n664\t| | `[AC-073] check-golden-frozen fails when a golden file is modified` |\n665\t| | `[AC-073] check-golden-frozen fails when a golden file is added` |\n666\t| | `[AC-073] check-golden-frozen fails when a golden file is deleted` |\n667\t| | `[AC-073] check-write-scope reports an unregistered spec or golden file` |\n668\t| | `[AC-073] check-write-scope reports changes outside the write scope` |\n669\t| | `[AC-073] check-write-scope reads write_scope from markdown front matter` |\n670\t| | `[AC-073] check-no-collab reports zero references in the repository` |\n671\t| | `[AC-073] check-no-collab reports the violating fixture and passes the clean fixture` |\n672\t| | `[AC-073] gen-contract-doc output equals the committed docs/contract.md` |\n673\t| | `[AC-073] check-contract-doc fails on a stale document` |\n674\t| | `[AC-073] snapshot contains every code, trigger, threshold, reason, mapping and semantic_change of interfaces section 5` |\n675\t| | `[AC-073] new check scripts are discoverable by check-fast` |\n676\t\n677\t各测试要点：\n678\t- 标题 4：测试内嵌 30 个 `[code, exit]` 与 retryable 为 true 的三个码，与 §3.3 比对。\n679\t- 标题 5：对 `decideGate` 穷举全部 route×布尔组合；断言返回值至多一个码，五个码各至少出现一次，`E_READONLY`/`E_CSRF` 只在 `session_valid` 为真时出现，`E_ADMIN_REQUIRED` 只在其为假时出现；并断言这五个码的 `trigger_id` 为 `select_view_without_admin`、`bootstrap_non_loopback`、`admin_route_no_session`、`write_route_readonly`、`write_route_csrf_invalid`，exit 分别为 2、8、8、8、8，http 均为 403。\n680\t- 标题 6：`WRITE_ROUTE_ORDER`、快照 `write_route_order` 与 `decideGate` 的先后（会话无效且 readonly 且 csrf 无效 → `E_ADMIN_REQUIRED`；会话有效、readonly、csrf 无效 → `E_READONLY`；会话有效、可写、csrf 无效 → `E_CSRF`）。\n681\t- 标题 8：静态扫描 `lib/contract/*.mjs`：`registry.mjs` 无 import 语句；其余文件无 `node:` 导入、无 `Date.now`/`new Date`/`setTimeout`/`setInterval`/`setImmediate`/`process.env`。\n682\t- 标题 14（validator 表驱动）：每个受支持关键字至少一个违规用例，断言 `path` 与 `keyword`（含 `required` 与 `additionalProperties` 的子路径约定、数组下标路径、跨文件 `$ref`）；另断言不支持的关键字（如 `oneOf`）抛 `TypeError`。\n683\t- 标题 13：schema 中 `reason`、`warnings[].code`、`error.code` 的 `enum` 与注册表对应列表集合相等。\n684\t- 标题 20（freeze）：对 `structuredClone(REGISTRY)` 做删除、改名、新增（版本号不变）三种变更，`checkFrozen` 分别返回含 `freeze.removed`、`freeze.removed`+`freeze.added`、`freeze.added` 的 `ok:false`。\n685\t- 标题 21～24：在临时 root 下放一个包装模块 `lib/contract/registry.mjs`（`import { REGISTRY as base } from '<真实 registry.mjs 的 file URL>'` 后导出修改过的 `REGISTRY`）和一份快照文件，运行 `snapshot-update.mjs --root <tmp>`，断言 §3.7 表里的退出码、首行和文件是否被改写；成功路径写出后，用 `checkFrozen(新快照, 新 REGISTRY)` 断言 ok。\n686\t- 标题 26～28：遍历 `forbidden.keys` 中每个键，在深度 1（`{ injected: ... }`，即根对象的直接键）和深度 3（`{a:{b:{<key>:1}}}`）注入；28 号在 `warnings[0]`、`error`、`rejected[0]`、数组套数组中各注入一次，断言 `hits` 含 `forbidden_key` 且 `path` 指向注入处。\n687\t- 标题 29：`Model_Key`、`MODEL_KEY` 命中；`model_keys`、`xmodel_key`、`model-key` 不命中。\n688\t- 标题 30～32：catalog 用 `contracts/examples` 之外的内嵌小目录（模型 id `claude-sonnet-5-5`，key `claude:claude-sonnet-5-5`，cli `claude`/`codex`/`agent`）；断言 id、key、cli 名作为字符串值或对象键、在深度 1 和 3 都命中；`claude-sonnet-5-5-extra`、`use claude here` 命中，`claudette`、`codexes` 不命中；`cliworker`、`config`、`dsh-CLIWorker`、`CLIWorker` 不命中。\n689\t- 标题 33：构造合规 call（`wrapper` 用测试内的任意绝对路径）→ 0 命中；`cwd` 含 `claude-sonnet-5-5` → 仍 0 命中；改 `command`、改 `args[3]`（与 lease 不符）、少一个键、多一个键 `model` → 各一个 `call_mismatch`，路径指向出错位置；顶层 `calls[i]` 同样适用。\n690\t- 标题 34：`contracts/examples/selection-ok.v1/valid/*`、`handle.v1/valid/*`、`selection-failed.v1/valid/*`、`error-envelope/valid/*` 在 catalog 与 wrapper 取自该样例本身时 0 命中（wrapper 参数从样例的 `call.command`、`args[0]`、`args[5]`、`args[7]` 取）。\n691\t- 标题 35：构造 1000 层嵌套对象，断言不抛异常且能在最深处命中禁用键。\n692\t- 标题 36：`git ls-files` 列出的集合覆盖 `contracts/registry.snapshot.json`、`contracts/agentline-forbidden.json`、`contracts/spec/*.json`、`contracts/golden/**` 的磁盘文件；每个文件 `git check-ignore -q` 返回 1（未被忽略）。不在 git 仓库内则失败。\n693\t- 标题 37：用 `validate` 对每个规格/金标文件做 schema 校验（`registry.snapshot.json`→`registry-snapshot`，`surfaces.json`→`surfaces`，`migration-map.json`→`migration-map`，`ac-index.json`→`ac-index`，`golden/**`（除 manifest）→`golden`，`manifest.json`→`golden-manifest`，`agentline-forbidden.json`→`agentline-forbidden`）；并断言 §3.6 一致性规则、`surfaces.semantic_change` id 集合与注册表相等、`migration-map.reasons` 与 `draft_reason_mapping` 逐项相同、`id` 全局唯一。\n694\t- 标题 40～42：把仓库的 `contracts/spec`、`contracts/golden` 复制到临时 